#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:1 8b92b5cc594d470ea293826305235c03
msgid "Web 交互实验平台"
msgstr "Interactive Web Platform"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:3 faf3b363c4bb4017990fd20a4982b6a5
msgid ""
"本指南介绍如何使用 UniKT 内置的 Web 实验管理平台。该平台采用前后端分离架构（后端基于 FastAPI + Uvicorn，前端基于 "
"Vue 3 + Vite + "
"TypeScript），提供涵盖训练任务提交、实时终端日志流式推送、超参数搜索可视化、数据集预处理控制台以及硬件资源监控的完整图形化交互体验。"
msgstr ""
"This guide introduces UniKT's built-in Web experiment management "
"platform. Built on a decoupled architecture (FastAPI + Uvicorn backend, "
"Vue 3 + Vite + TypeScript frontend), it provides a complete graphical "
"experience covering job submission, real-time terminal log streaming, "
"hyperparameter search visualization, dataset preprocessing consoles, and "
"hardware resource telemetry."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:5 05b193c9f39f4c989022fe00ce286ca2
msgid "目标与适用场景"
msgstr "Objectives & Use Cases"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:7 4d728c928f204c8ca27220d432e1f18b
msgid "无需手写繁琐的命令行参数，通过可视化表单快速配置并提交模型训练与评测任务。"
msgstr ""
"Configure and submit model training and evaluation tasks through visual "
"forms without hand-writing verbose CLI arguments."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:8 2142ad6605504e20a46204416b808389
msgid "实时通过 WebSocket 监听任务终端输出，支持随时终止或重试运行中的任务。"
msgstr ""
"Stream task terminal outputs in real time via WebSockets, with one-click "
"job cancellation or re-running."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:9 362c56c707aa44769d0ad753059fe048
msgid "在线创建 Optuna 超参数搜索任务，直观查看收敛曲线与试验参数对比。"
msgstr ""
"Create Optuna hyperparameter searches online, visually inspecting "
"convergence curves and comparing trial parameters."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:10 834de88508ef4b81b4a6d58eeaf7e65d
msgid "图形化管理 15 个数据集处理器（涵盖 14 个公开学术数据集）的一键下载与分步预处理。"
msgstr ""
"Graphically manage one-click downloading and step-by-step preprocessing "
"across 15 dataset processors (covering 14 public academic datasets)."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:11 7db8d126561d459ba1a44bd1f5ea028b
msgid "实时监控服务器 GPU 显存利用率、计算核心负载、CPU 与内存动态。"
msgstr ""
"Monitor server GPU VRAM utilization, compute core loads, CPU usage, and "
"system memory dynamics in real time."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:13 5c280ee0664a464dbc3cdb73b192f025
msgid "前置条件"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:15 4642491c84d54da59311e8d31b854bf2
msgid "**环境准备**：使用 Pixi 切换至支持 Web 功能的环境或通过 `-e web` 运行命令："
msgstr ""
"**Environment**: Activate the Web environment via Pixi or run commands "
"with `-e web`:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:16 586c0f62318b47e886f8de640343302b
msgid "pixi run -e web <task>\n"
msgstr "pixi run -e web <task>\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:19 a277861dd4a241699348acae138001cd
msgid "**首次安装依赖**：前端依赖已由 Pixi 与 npm 共同托管。初次使用时确保环境已解析就绪。"
msgstr ""
"**Initial Dependency Setup**: Frontend dependencies are managed jointly "
"by Pixi and npm. Ensure the environment is resolved before initial use."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:21 c213cb3cf3074260ac3cde860cae2c84
msgid "启动服务"
msgstr "Starting Services"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:23 60dd2aecee484be89a20bc2298344292
msgid "UniKT 提供了多种启动命令以适应不同的开发与生产部署需求："
msgstr ""
"UniKT provides several launch commands tailored for development and "
"production deployments:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:25 f978b90dbdc149839cbe4361bf65b337
msgid "1. 开发模式"
msgstr "1\\. Development Mode"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:27 af628d61b5f8478fbe62ca7364c7c2d8
msgid "启动全栈热重载开发服务器（同时运行 FastAPI 后端与 Vite 前端）："
msgstr ""
"Start the full-stack hot-reloading development server (running FastAPI "
"backend and Vite frontend concurrently):"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:29 9574b1d7c7d84881be366b9c152674f0
msgid "pixi run web-dev\n"
msgstr "pixi run web-dev\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:33 7eb389a68b98424aa9a92bd0d293edb0
msgid "**前端交互界面**：访问 [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173)"
msgstr "**Frontend UI**: Visit [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173)"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:34 7ab7e69f6b904e14b16faaa127bcba30
msgid ""
"**后端 OpenAPI 接口文档**：访问 "
"[http://localhost:8765/docs](http://localhost:8765/docs)"
msgstr ""
"**Backend OpenAPI Docs**: Visit "
"[http://localhost:8765/docs](http://localhost:8765/docs)"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:37 cb6500186dee41fe8415680518459b2e
msgid "若需更改前端端口，可以在 `.env` 中设置 `KT_WEB_PORT=5173`。"
msgstr "To change the frontend port, set `KT_WEB_PORT=5173` in `.env`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:40 3b1e7e02e8ae417c80c23b2c5d4fceec
msgid "2. 独立分步启动"
msgstr "2\\. Independent Step-by-Step Launch"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:42 00ea25f180bf46fcb2670e9a5c814f70
msgid "若需对前后端进行独立调试，可以分别启动："
msgstr ""
"For independent debugging of backend and frontend services, start them "
"separately:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:44 30bcafdbeb1d433b800806b1960885b8
msgid ""
"# 启动后端 API（端口 8765）\n"
"pixi run web-backend\n"
"\n"
"# 新终端中启动前端 Vite 开发服务器（端口 5173）\n"
"pixi run web-frontend\n"
msgstr ""
"# Start backend API (port 8765)\n"
"pixi run web-backend\n"
"\n"
"# Start frontend Vite dev server in a new terminal (port 5173)\n"
"pixi run web-frontend\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:52 dfb1fd97831d459f885f1314dc670406
msgid "3. 常驻服务模式"
msgstr "3\\. Production Daemon Mode"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:54 33a969a276d34f18a797a3bbfd0828e0
msgid "在团队共享服务器或局域网工作站长期提供访问时，先构建前端静态资源，并通过静态资源服务器启动预览服务，后端保持在本地回路安全运行："
msgstr ""
"For long-term hosting on team servers or LAN workstations, compile "
"frontend static assets and launch preview serving while keeping the "
"backend safely bound to loopback:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:56 53e354c6ec7a447b89c7786f004358a1
msgid "pixi run web-serve\n"
msgstr "pixi run web-serve\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:60 7a44946939ba4fa59bfded86b39716aa
msgid ""
"此命令将自动执行 `npm run build`，在后台启动后端 API，并通过 Vite Preview 绑定 "
"`0.0.0.0`，允许局域网内其他机器通过服务器 IP 访问 Web 平台。"
msgstr ""
"This command runs `npm run build`, launches the API backend in the "
"background, and binds Vite Preview to `0.0.0.0`, allowing other machines "
"on the LAN to access the Web platform via server IP."

