"Select target models from a dropdown dynamically synchronized with "
"supported models."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:98 6e62b6be559c49579ae8ec865116b129
msgid "选择预处理好的数据集与 K 折折数。"
msgstr "Select preprocessed datasets and cross-validation fold counts."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:99 1c0dcaf74e3f49d497dbe038d219ce12
msgid "模型专属超参数表单会根据该模型的 `ModelConfig` 动态渲染，附带默认值与取值范围校验。"
msgstr ""
"Model-specific hyperparameter forms render dynamically based on "
"`ModelConfig`, with default values and validation rules."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:100
#: 1f5e027226604389beb31242b5f6d990
msgid "支持配置早停监控指标、随机种子、确定性算法及 GPU 设备编号。"
msgstr ""
"Configure early stopping metrics, seeds, deterministic algorithms, and "
"GPU device IDs."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:101
#: 4bb75d3e713e46fe9728e048eee962f3
msgid "**任务列表与状态看板**："
