msgstr ""
"Centralized dashboard displaying jobs in queued, running, completed, or "
"failed states."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:103
#: 10a0758c7d7746629bd3f3093396e3fd
msgid "**实时日志流**："
msgstr "**Real-Time Log Streaming**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:104
#: 133d85db574942a3874042d36e98299c
msgid "点击任意任务进入详情页，通过 WebSocket 实时接收终端输出，无需登录服务器。"
