"Click any job to stream live terminal logs over WebSocket without needing"
" SSH access."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:105
#: d576df3b268d4beb80373fdbc4d5e92a
msgid "支持对运行中的任务执行一键终止，或对异常中断的任务重新运行。"
msgstr "Cancel running jobs with one click or re-run failed tasks instantly."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:107
#: 24fab07b631f45c38908fd792f54700b
msgid "2. 超参数搜索管理"
msgstr "2\\. Hyperparameter Search Management"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:109
#: 0bb9d4a6ca7b495295af604d193b8dcc
msgid "**创建搜索试验**："
msgstr "**Create Search Studies**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:110
#: 067afd8453144ee396f582d61f65b79d
