msgid "选择模型与数据集后，系统自动列出该模型 `metadata={'optuna': ...}` 声明的所有可搜索参数及其上下界。"
msgstr ""
"After choosing a model and dataset, the UI lists all tunable parameters "
"and bounds declared in `metadata={'optuna': ...}`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:111
#: 6571026d541b4987808e7f03495218e9
msgid "配置试验总数、TPE 或 NSGA-II 采样算法，以及中位数或百分位数剪枝策略。"
msgstr ""
"Configure trial counts, TPE or NSGA-II sampling, and median/percentile "
"pruners."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:112
#: c5ffa8915eb345d997e2f0eab432fa7a
msgid "**交互式试验可视化**："
msgstr "**Interactive Study Visualizations**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:113
#: bdf234c374b04a4290fff48d4004edbd
msgid "动态展示各 Trial 的优化目标收敛折线图。"
msgstr "Visualize real-time optimization convergence curves across trials."

