#: 2f9690cb27bf43b384842f7a5273acab
msgid "支持导出最优超参数字典，并直接从界面一键生成重跑任务。"
msgstr ""
"Export optimal hyperparameter dictionaries and launch reproduction runs "
"directly."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:117
