#: 395939ac2c9a499c9f488a6b20aba363
msgid "**数据集全局清单**："
msgstr "**Global Dataset Inventory**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:120
#: e65d531d7719412ba71c66d468ac3518
msgid ""
"查看 UniKT 支持的 15 个标准数据集处理器，涵盖 ASSISTments 系列、EdNet-KT1、Junyi2015、KDD Cup "
"2010 与 XES3G5M 等。"
msgstr ""
"View the 15 standard dataset processors supported by UniKT, covering the "
"ASSISTments series, EdNet-KT1, Junyi2015, KDD Cup 2010, XES3G5M, and "
"more."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:121
#: 0f685dc258fb4f9bb8a4f79516c412f8
msgid "显示每个数据集的下载状态、处理状态及磁盘占用大小。"
msgstr ""
"Displays download status, preprocessing status, and disk footprints for "
"each dataset."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:122
#: dadf95190ad04e66903b36395acbbda4
msgid "**一键下载与流水线处理**："
msgstr "**One-Click Download and Pipeline Execution**:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:123
#: e8f3d51c10c54120bfccd9cc37949e11
msgid "点击“下载”按钮从官方源或镜像自动拉取原始数据。"
msgstr ""
"Click \"Download\" to pull raw archives automatically from official "
"sources or mirrors."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:124
#: c77a83021580443ab86971d31af68ec5
msgid "点击“处理”按钮触发自动化清洗、题目与知识点映射，以及 5 折 Parquet 序列生成。"
msgstr ""
"Click \"Process\" to trigger automated cleaning, entity mappings, and "
"5-fold Parquet generation."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:125
#: 7a1e407492a74aa28ca710bcbad07e62
msgid "界面实时显示预处理流水线进度条与状态反馈。"
msgstr "Real-time pipeline progress bars and step-by-step telemetry feedback."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:127
#: 45a13fdb89c0444d95f5bf8914cf6bf4
msgid "4. 硬件与系统资源监控"
msgstr "4\\. Hardware and System Resource Telemetry"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:129
#: baa6d9e248e24a4387c2bf2484061420
