#: 5f9855d833ca4945b42d72e8ada7c963
msgid "检测系统中所有可用的 NVIDIA GPU 设备。"
msgstr "Detects all available NVIDIA GPU devices in the system."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:131
#: 61b7c97c292042ca899578f11590e675
msgid "实时绘制各 GPU 的计算核心利用率、显存占用量及当前温度。"
msgstr "Plots core compute utilization, VRAM usage, and temperatures in real time."

