#: 9ee9111dd27240e1886352dd62a87558
msgid "监控主机 CPU 总体占用率与每个核心的负载分布。"
msgstr "Monitors aggregate host CPU usage and per-core load distributions."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:134
#: a4e4791100da47199742948841fc0b14
