msgid "常见排查提示"
msgstr "Common Troubleshooting Tips"

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:155
#: 5715b96b4844481fa5c97fc8f019787c
msgid "**端口冲突**：若 `8765` 或 `5173` 被占用，可检查后台残留进程或在 `.env` 中修改 `KT_WEB_PORT`。"
msgstr ""
"**Port Conflicts**: If `8765` or `5173` is occupied, check for orphaned "
"processes or change `KT_WEB_PORT` in `.env`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/web-platform.md:156
#: e0791f6e46f1477fbe897383884f03ef
msgid ""
"**WebSocket 断连**：若通过 Nginx 反向代理访问 Web 平台，请确保 Nginx 配置中开启了 `Upgrade` 与 "
"`Connection: Upgrade` 头部转发。"
msgstr ""
"**WebSocket Disconnections**: If accessing via an Nginx reverse proxy, "
"ensure `Upgrade` and `Connection: Upgrade` headers are forwarded."
